### Health
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

### Create payment
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1001",
  "customerId": "CUS-101",
  "amount": 1499.00,
  "currency": "INR"
}

### Create duplicate payment for the same order - expects 409
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1001",
  "customerId": "CUS-101",
  "amount": 1499.00,
  "currency": "INR"
}

### Get payment - replace with paymentId from create response
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
